1) Function for efficienca metrics: 
NSE 
Input: 
- observed discharge (aa_run_model: diso - row: 51)
- simulated discharge (aa_run_model: diss - row: 128)

NSE = 1 - (sum(obs_i - sim_i)^2)/(sum(obs_i - mean(Obs))^2)

Output:
- NSE value 
(very good: 0.75 < NSE<= 1; 
good: 0.65 < NSE <= 0.75; 
satisfactory: 0.5 < NSE <=0.65; 
unsatisfactory: NSE <= 0.5)

